{"id":219,"slug":"knife-in-the-water","title":"Knife in the Water","year":1962,"country":"Poland","duration":94,"spine":215,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/219-knife-in-the-water","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/1d9d5fece5c4c3cc639df4968f5d91bd/s0Sn7ygO2rHmYAmNkjIX5OwPkAYCf7_large.jpg","description":"Roman Polanski’s first feature is a brilliant psychological thriller that many critics still consider among his greatest work. The story is simple, yet the implications of its characters’ emotions and actions are profound. When a young hitchhiker joins a couple on a weekend yacht trip, psychological warfare breaks out as the two men compete for the woman’s attention. A storm forces the small crew below deck, and tension builds to a violent climax. With stinging dialogue and a mercilessly probing camera, Polanski creates a disturbing study of fear, humiliation, sexuality, and aggression. This remarkable directorial debut won Polanski worldwide acclaim, a place on the cover of Time, and his first Oscar nomination.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Roman Polanski","slug":"roman-polanski"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Leon Niemczyk","role":"Andrzej","slug":"leon-niemczyk"},{"actor":"Jolanta Umecka","role":"Krystyna","slug":"jolanta-umecka"},{"actor":"Zygmunt Malanowicz","role":"Young Man","slug":"zygmunt-malanowicz"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Roman Polanski","slug":"roman-polanski"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Stanislaw Zylewicz","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Jerzy Lipman","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Roman Polanski","slug":"roman-polanski"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Jakub Goldberg","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Jerzy Skolimowski","slug":"jerzy-skolimowski"},{"role":"Music","person":"Krzysztof Komeda","slug":null},{"role":"Editing","person":"Halina Prugar","slug":null}],"pickedBy":[{"session":681,"title":"Jerry Schatzberg’s Closet Picks","date":"2024-05-22","video":"htt